    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(6th Level)</em></p><p><strong>Noise:</strong> +1</p><p><em>“Pull the minutes.”</em></p><p>Once per Soma Break, you may consult the Akashic record and ask the GM one question about <strong>patterns</strong> (not secrets).</p><p>Examples:</p><ul><li><p>Has something like this happened before?</p></li><li><p>What precedent is being violated?</p></li><li><p>What does the world expect here?</p></li></ul><p>You are not uncovering hidden facts—you are reading structural repetition.</p><h3>Cost</h3><p>No Surge required.</p><h3>Pushback</h3><p>None. Observation does not ossify narrative. Only enforcement does.</p>",
